  "description": "48\" Fork Blades Quick Tach Skid Steer Tractor Pallet Fork Attachment 4000lbs\nFitment\nEasily attach this Pallet Fork Frame to a wide range of skid steers, loaders, and tractors including popular models like New Holland, Bobcat Skid Steer, and Kubota tractors.\nFeatures\nAdjustable Pallet Fork : The pallet fork frame is a quick-connect skid steer that can be directly installed on the machine. The pallet fork blades can be freely moved on the skid steer frame, with the distance adjustable within a 17-37 inch range.\nRobust Load Capacity: The 4,000 lb load capacity of the pallet fork is sufficient to handle most tasks, without worry of the frame bending or deforming.\nRust-Resistant Durability: The all-steel design with an orange rust-resistant coating prevents corrosion, ensuring continued use throughout the seasons.\nExtensive Compatibility: This pallet fork is suitable for most loaders and tractors, including Bobcat Skid Steer, New Holland, and Kubota models, making it ideal for handling farm, factory, warehouse, and construction site work.\nDetailed Specifications and Reliable Service: The package includes 1 pallet fork frame and 2 pallet fork blades. We will reply to any of your questions via Amazon email within 24 hours.\nAdjustable Pallet Fork : The pallet fork frame is a quick-connect skid steer that can be directly installed on the machine. The pallet fork blades can be freely moved on the skid steer frame, with the distance adjustable within a 17-37 inch range.\nRobust Load Capacity: The 4,000 lb load capacity of the pallet fork is sufficient to handle most tasks, without worry of the frame bending or deforming.",
